# gujiconform -- Phase 2 (Platform IO pass): note($value) writes the display
# form + newline to STDERR (Section 15.4). It is print's diagnostic twin, so
# stdout stays clean (only the print line) while the note lines land on stderr.
# Both engines must agree on stdout AND stderr. Expected output is derived from
# the spec (print's display rendering, redirected to stderr), not captured.
sub main() {
    print("out")
    note("note line")
    note(42)
}
